  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1202",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-25T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-25T12:07:48.549Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल कोशी, मधेश र बागमती प्रदेशका सम्पुर्ण भू-भाग, गण्डकी प्रदेशको केही भू-भाग र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको पूर्वी भू-भागको थोरै स्थानमा मनसुनी वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ । अन्य भू-भागमा पश्चिमी वायू र स्थानीय वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, the monsoon has influenced the entire areas of Koshi, Madhesh and Bagmati Provinces, some parts of Gandaki Province, and a few areas in the eastern part of Lumbini Province. The remaining parts of the country are under the partial influence of westerly winds and local winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भाग र मधेश प्रदेशमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । बागमती, गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भाग तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ ।  लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भाग तथा मधेश प्रदेशका थोरै स्थानमा तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराईका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are expected in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in Madhesh Province and the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces and in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpaschim Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpaschim Provinces.  The weather will remain mainly fair in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpaschim Provinces. There is a possibility of moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is also likely at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and Madhesh Province, and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश प्रदेश तथा बागमती, गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भाग तथा मधेश प्रदेशका थोरै स्थानमा, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराईका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तातो लहर तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा पनि  तातो दिन हुने सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are expected in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country as well as in the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpaschim Provinces. There is a possibility of moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is also likely at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and Madhesh Province, and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.   Heat wave conditions are likely at some places in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpaschim Provinces, while hot day conditions may also occur at some places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
